#. module: ko_pos_cloud_print
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/ko_pos_cloud_print/static/src/app/ko_cloud_printer.js:0
msgid "The shop print agent is not responding. Check that the PC running it is switched on and connected to the shop network, then try again."
